{"3265840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BioEden", "steam_appid": 3265840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras/ce8ab9d2e6c2d077741b94b262ed4e01.avif?t=1788259559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras_big/ce8ab9d2e6c2d077741b94b262ed4e01.webp?t=1788259559 width=1560 height=320 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to BioEden, a cozy management game where you will build a self-sustaining network of structures, all working in harmony to bring extinct animals back to life. As a Keeper, you have been entrusted by the Cosmic Collective to bring life back to a planet quietly waiting to be healed. Every healing begins with a single step. This one is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras/2fd97deb253adc8ec7f9e42ea271b482.avif?t=1788259559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras_big/2fd97deb253adc8ec7f9e42ea271b482.webp?t=1788259559 width=1560 height=320 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras/0aa9eec195c9f032348a3564d9ed8065.avif?t=1788259559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras_big/0aa9eec195c9f032348a3564d9ed8065.webp?t=1788259559 width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon your arrival, search for debris sites scattered across the land, they are the foundation of your journey. Recycle them into resources, and use those to build the base of your network: a solar energy system to generate electricity, and a water system to distribute it across all your buildings. Connect them together, weave a network across the land, and manage the supply and demand for every structure you create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But plan with care. Each addition to your planet consumes resources, draws on energy, and nudges pollution upward. Find the balance between creation, exploration, and restraint, to accomplish the very mission that brought you here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras/d82835cada1584771496bd456c6b2679.avif?t=1788259559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras_big/d82835cada1584771496bd456c6b2679.webp?t=1788259559 width=1560 height=320 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras/eecaa7fb819911bd2ce395488a83141d.avif?t=1788259559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras_big/eecaa7fb819911bd2ce395488a83141d.webp?t=1788259559 width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world reached out, and you answered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recycle your buildings once they have served their purpose. Purify your planet’s lakes and rivers. Reclaim its forgotten ruins. Restore the soil, and watch as life slowly returns to a landscape that had almost given up. Transform this barren planet into a thriving eden, and leave no trace that you were ever there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not just building a home. You are becoming a force of renewal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras/5ec3333a606926b03f279cc99b334ae4.avif?t=1788259559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras_big/5ec3333a606926b03f279cc99b334ae4.webp?t=1788259559 width=1560 height=320 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras/30f96e6e87cdf53298ca1e8dc5875ad4.avif?t=1788259559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras_big/30f96e6e87cdf53298ca1e8dc5875ad4.webp?t=1788259559 width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your planet, life is ready to return. Inside your dome, you'll welcome back dozens of extraordinary species, each with its own needs. Gather DNA samples, place your cocoons, and carefully tend to the conditions each creature requires: temperature, humidity, and the right vegetation to make them feel truly at home. Meet their needs, and watch these gentle beings flourish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras/cbb0e653d6337b4166f278d06f75cc3b.avif?t=1788259559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras_big/cbb0e653d6337b4166f278d06f75cc3b.webp?t=1788259559 width=1560 height=320 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras/fd1fdf83b7fee14536241f4513043615.avif?t=1788259559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras_big/fd1fdf83b7fee14536241f4513043615.webp?t=1788259559 width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Collective brings together five distinct Guilds, each with its own identity, abilities, and archetype. United by a shared goal, each Guild also pursues its own ambitions, shaped by its core purpose and values. Your choice of Guild defines how you approach your mission: the methods may differ, the philosophies may clash, but the planet needs healing all the same. Choose your path wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras/76fa61b56c424f2c3e5e522180e61b38.avif?t=1788259559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras_big/76fa61b56c424f2c3e5e522180e61b38.webp?t=1788259559 width=1560 height=320 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras/ffc164aa139b88652dc785c6262ea91d.avif?t=1788259559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras_big/ffc164aa139b88652dc785c6262ea91d.webp?t=1788259559 width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In BioEden, you can take the time you need. No fail states, no pressure, just the quiet pull of discovery and the deep satisfaction of watching a world transform through your choices. Let the soft sounds of nature envelop you as you tend, wander, and watch your planet gently come back to life.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras/ce8ab9d2e6c2d077741b94b262ed4e01.avif?t=1788259559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras_big/ce8ab9d2e6c2d077741b94b262ed4e01.webp?t=1788259559 width=1560 height=320 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to BioEden, a cozy management game where you will build a self-sustaining network of structures, all working in harmony to bring extinct animals back to life. As a Keeper, you have been entrusted by the Cosmic Collective to bring life back to a planet quietly waiting to be healed. Every healing begins with a single step. This one is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras/2fd97deb253adc8ec7f9e42ea271b482.avif?t=1788259559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras_big/2fd97deb253adc8ec7f9e42ea271b482.webp?t=1788259559 width=1560 height=320 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras/0aa9eec195c9f032348a3564d9ed8065.avif?t=1788259559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras_big/0aa9eec195c9f032348a3564d9ed8065.webp?t=1788259559 width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon your arrival, search for debris sites scattered across the land, they are the foundation of your journey. Recycle them into resources, and use those to build the base of your network: a solar energy system to generate electricity, and a water system to distribute it across all your buildings. Connect them together, weave a network across the land, and manage the supply and demand for every structure you create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But plan with care. Each addition to your planet consumes resources, draws on energy, and nudges pollution upward. Find the balance between creation, exploration, and restraint, to accomplish the very mission that brought you here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras/d82835cada1584771496bd456c6b2679.avif?t=1788259559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras_big/d82835cada1584771496bd456c6b2679.webp?t=1788259559 width=1560 height=320 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras/eecaa7fb819911bd2ce395488a83141d.avif?t=1788259559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras_big/eecaa7fb819911bd2ce395488a83141d.webp?t=1788259559 width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world reached out, and you answered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recycle your buildings once they have served their purpose. Purify your planet’s lakes and rivers. Reclaim its forgotten ruins. Restore the soil, and watch as life slowly returns to a landscape that had almost given up. Transform this barren planet into a thriving eden, and leave no trace that you were ever there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not just building a home. You are becoming a force of renewal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras/5ec3333a606926b03f279cc99b334ae4.avif?t=1788259559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras_big/5ec3333a606926b03f279cc99b334ae4.webp?t=1788259559 width=1560 height=320 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras/30f96e6e87cdf53298ca1e8dc5875ad4.avif?t=1788259559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265840/extras_big/30f96e6e87cdf53298ca1e8dc5875ad4.webp?t=1788259559 width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your planet, life is ready to return. Inside your dome, you'll welcome back dozens of extraordinary species, each with its own needs. Gather DNA samples, place your cocoons, and carefu